; quests.xon -- the delve set: the people met below, and what they ask.
;
; (quest NAME GIVER . PROPS): the GIVER creature, one that talks, stands
; on (level N) and is spoken to by walking into it.  (wants bring ITEM
; ...) lays each token on a level, the last on the giver's and the rest
; on those above it, or in a (carrier "kind") creature's keeping there;
; (wants explore) wants every cell of the giver's level seen.  (ask ...)
; is said at the first meeting, (again ...) until the want is met,
; (done ...) with it, and then one of (rewards (CLASS NAME) (CLASS
; NAME)) is the player's to choose.

(quest "the lamp" "lampman" (level 2)
  (wants bring "the foreman's lamp") (carrier "knocker")
  (ask "I kept the lamps at the breach.  When the crew went down I went too,"
       "and I did not come back up.  I do not mind that.  I mind the dark."
       "A crawler took my lamp when I fell.  Bring it back, and you may have"
       "something from the store I kept.")
  (again "No lamp yet.  It will be where the crawlers are.")
  (done "That is mine.  Set it there, where I can see it.  Now take your pick:")
  (rewards (weapon "miner's blade") (armour "scale coat")))

(quest "the survey" "surveyor" (level 5)
  (wants explore)
  (ask "I came down to level the works, and the water took my chain and my"
       "glass.  I cannot see past my own lamp now.  Walk this level for me,"
       "every passage of it, and tell me its shape.  I will pay.")
  (again "Not the whole of it yet.  There are passages you have not walked.")
  (done "That is the shape of it.  Good.  The Guild will never see this map,"
        "but you will have something for it:")
  (rewards (wand "sparks") (ring "vigour")))

(quest "the pump" "pump-wright" (level 9)
  (wants bring "pump valve" "pump crank" "pump seal")
  (ask "Hollis.  I worked the engine house, and I will work this one, if it"
       "can be made to draw.  It wants a valve, a crank and a seal, and the"
       "keepers have scattered them through the Old Works.  Bring them, and"
       "whatever is left in the store is yours.")
  (again "Valve, crank, seal.  Not all three yet.")
  (done "That will do.  Go on down, then; I will have it drawing by the time"
        "you come back up, for all the good it will do either of us.  Take one:")
  (rewards (weapon "foreman's pick") (ring "silence")))

; The tallyman, (keeper NAME (level N) . PROPS), keeps a shop a band
; ahead of the player: on the first level of each band after the first,
; near where the player comes onto it.  (sells (CLASS NAME) ...) is his
; stock, (buys CLASS ...) what he takes, at the set's (worth ...) or an
; item's own (price N) (shops.x); each LINE is said over the counter.
(keeper "tallyman" (level 4)
  (sells (potion "mending") (oil "oil flask") (food "miner's tin") (scroll "blink")
         (weapon "miner's blade") (armour "scale coat"))
  (buys potion scroll wand ring weapon armour food oil)
  "Tickets or coin.  I take both down here, and nobody up top honours either."
  "I came down with the crew, and I kept the tally.  Somebody has to.")
(keeper "tallyman" (level 7)
  (sells (potion "mending") (oil "oil flask") (food "miner's tin") (scroll "blink")
         (weapon "sledge") (armour "plated harness"))
  (buys potion scroll wand ring weapon armour food oil)
  "Still walking?  Good.  The water took the last one who owed me."
  "The stone down here is older than the mine.  It does not care for trade.")
(keeper "tallyman" (level 10)
  (sells (potion "mending") (oil "oil flask") (food "miner's tin") (scroll "blink")
         (potion "deep mending") (wand "sparks"))
  (buys potion scroll wand ring weapon armour food oil)
  "This is as far as I go.  The light below is not lamplight."
  "Whatever you carry back up, I will buy.  Whatever you carry down, you will need.")
